_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TjnPckpw1V6GG3ACi9dAUF", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 822095, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TjnPckpw1V6GG3ACi9dAUF", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 825685, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01BcvUfHJLLYUUXRd7fU3joK", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-worker errors after v3.4.0 deploy", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "payments-worker v3.4.0 (deployed this morning) is unhealthy with an 18% error rate in us-east, us-west and eu-west. payments-api (v5.1.0) is also showing 18% errors, which are downstream of the worker. Rolled payments-worker back to v3.3.0, its last release that was healthy in production. Watching to confirm recovery of both services.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.9}, "confidence": 0.9}, {"t_ms": 826285, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01BcvUfHJLLYUUXRd7fU3joK", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 826285, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BcvUfHJLLYUUXRd7fU3joK", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 832278, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled payments-worker back to v3.3.0 and opened the SEV2. The worker has recovered, but payments-api is still showing errors.\n\n- **Rollback:** payments-worker is now on v3.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It's healthy, and its error rate fell from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is